  "body.roll_deg": "+ toward the bird's far-wing side",
  "body.squash": "vertical scale multiplier, pivot at the feet",
  "head.tilt_deg": "+ beak down/forward",
  "head.turn_px": "+ toward the facing direction",
  "head.lift_px": "+ up",
  "wing_near.raise_deg": "+ up about the shoulder",
  "wing_far.raise_deg": "+ up about the shoulder",
  "wings.span": "rigid width scale for folding (1 = rest)",
  "tail.lift_deg": "+ up",
  "legs.reach_deg": "+ forward (talons lead)",
  "_rules": "Codex maps each semantic channel to per-view rigid transforms with the exported view transforms (front 135\u00b0, rear 315\u00b0); never mirror one view's anatomy into the other. Default interpolation 'smooth' (cubic ease in-out) between keys; 'step2' = linear over exactly 2 frames then hold. Feet stay planted (no body lift) in idle, hit and hover entry unless a key says otherwise."
